%% Local evidence placeholder; syntax based on Mermaid sequence diagram documentation (MIT): https://github.com/mermaid-js/mermaid
%% Use only evidenced calls, events, and failure handling.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant S as Source
    participant J as Job
    participant D as Data store
    S->>J: [trigger / input]
    J->>D: [write / transform]
    D-->>J: [result / acknowledgement]
